  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nCriminals aren’t born – they are made.<p></p>\n<p>Welcome to the early 2000s! You are Eddie, and a lifestyle of bad choices made you an outlaw seeking refuge. Don’t worry tho, Isla Sombra is the perfect place for fugitives like you!</p>\n<p>You’re not planning to just surrender and stay there forever though. Prove your worth, use your talents and get your life back! Making a fortune along the way won’t hurt either…</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Many improved and many new ways of acquiring, processing and distributing narcotics. Buy and produce drugs or byproducts, and process, mix and/or purify them to achieve the desired quality.\n</li><li>Singleplayer or co-op mode.\n</li><li>Expansive and varied environments, from small villages to harbors to towns and everything in between.\n</li><li>Improved A.I., both for NPCs and enemies. Militia can raid a village and harass the townsfolk.\n</li><li>Unique economy with two currencies – the local one and the much desired U.S. dollar.\n</li><li>Early 2000s technology and an atmosphere of a Caribbean dictatorship, full of colorful characters with their own ambitions and agendas.\n</li></ul>\n",
